- Replace Olive Studio with Mint Candy
- Improve contrast and visual hierarchy across all themes
- Make adjacent-month dates and calendar events easier to distinguish
- Add semantic theme colors and macOS Increase Contrast support
- Soften the Today marker while preserving accessible contrast
